{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","维拉"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名身手矫健的刺客，能在战斗时切换远程和近战两种战斗模式并会对敌方后排造成巨大威胁。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","那么，这次的宝物是什么呢？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","What kind of treasure awaits us today?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","棒极了，这次的投资不会让您失望哦？"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Excellent. A wise investment. As you'll soon see."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","正中靶心。"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Right down the center."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","终将归于黑夜……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","All things... fade... to black..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","这次的胜利，就由我纳入囊中了~"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Another victory to my name."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","噢？您认识我吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","秘密是最美妙的化妆品，总能让人魅力翻倍，你不这么觉得吗？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","在白天飞翔的鸟儿真是可爱，不过，夜晚的鸟儿也不差吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","小家伙。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我曾见过许多奇珍，但这些……你很有眼光。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢你的赠礼。"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","昼华夜影"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","优雅的白昼与神秘的夜晚，都是她的舞台。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","荆棘蔷薇"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","在这支舞结束前，别想逃出她的陷阱。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","秘银贵宾等级提升至11级可领取该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","传说"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","偶尔也需要小憩"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","今晚的目标是……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","那么，来喝杯茶吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是可爱的灯光"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日有什么安排吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","很有巧思的摆设"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","假期打算怎么过？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","有许多拍卖机构会出重金邀请维拉夫人这样的鉴赏家来参加，以展示自己的专业性。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","有一件珍宝的真伪让许多鉴赏家争论不休，直到维拉夫人分辨出了它是真货，不久后它就被盗走。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","维拉夫人常去的旅行目的地都有她的私人行馆。曾有人试图闯入空置的行馆，却被一个黑衣的神秘女性击晕后扔了出去。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“那鸟我见过，可惜没被我逮住，你说为什么这鸟明明是贵族夫人养的，却要到黑市来。”——企图抓鸟的被骑士团逮捕的黑市摊贩。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","自从维拉夫人带着鸟出席各种活动，贵族圈就开始流行起养鸟的风潮。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","奎城最知名的伞店橱窗里的新款永远都有“已被维拉夫人预订”的小标签。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","耀光帝国全境的黑市上长期挂着一则高价悬赏，目标是一个身份不详、使用刺枪的女贼。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","记者曾暗中调查维拉夫人拍品的幕后卖家，却从未成功地查出那些稀世珍宝的来源。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","根据维拉夫人慈善基金会最近一次公布的善款使用明细，维拉夫人的捐助范围已经覆盖了耀光帝国全境。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","维达夫人慈善基金会的工作人员透露，夫人往往只需要几分钟就能判定一个项目的真伪。"],["/affinity_tales/10/text_i18n/cn","有一首流传甚广的歌谣，大意是小孩子晚上不睡觉，灰烬魔女就会用火焰烧掉他们的眉毛。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","那个维拉夫人，到底是什么来头……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10411040.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","维伦 & 维拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","日安，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，您来得正好。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415023.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","维拉"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","偶尔也需要小憩"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415048.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","维拉"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","那么，来喝杯茶吧"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415049.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","维拉"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","真是可爱的灯光"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415349.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","维拉"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","节日有什么安排吗？"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415350.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","维拉"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","很有巧思的摆设"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415517.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","维拉"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","假期打算怎么过？"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415518.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","维拉"]]}